 avatar,\nI will leave the composition and design to you.\n\nI would like to use the illustration as a thumbnail for distribution,\nI would like to use the illustration as a thumbnail for distribution.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10OmN-2nAgEZ9Vd50UcUsX_AaBhyX19y6/view", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamoyamo_MO/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2704614, "client_id": 1323432, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=339b65103cf79449f900b87559c4a731", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=339b65103cf79449f900b87559c4a731, https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7aa773b22a6cd28595777b724ffd4928 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8db28ab29a649f1f1e570da58b0d86c1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c36b6e8f208c4f023c566caf9e965a50", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c36b6e8f208c4f023c566caf9e965a50, https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bea24d7f14cf32bf5b8acc96573a501f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c58c7761/uploads/origins/47328854-bce4-4e09-a90b-50dc36553ab4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f9c2fd3173a585d03ac6b5eb13e76a5 3x"}, "body": "Greetings ヤモャ sensei, I'm Akane Nuibari, a time-traveling seamstress from Hong Kong.\n\nI recently came across sensei's work on my homepage and was really intrigued by sensei's chibi art!\nTherefore, I would like to request sensei to draw a set of emotes for my friend to use in an upcoming livestream.\nThese emotes will only be used for livestream-related materials (thumbnail etc.)/ by my friend as an icon or reaction pics only.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RVqjTXibw-24ziuUw2ChcDnge1Hxixjy\n\nShe works in the IT department in the same company as I do and often acted as the voice of reason within my friend groups.\n\nIn this commission, I would like sensei to draw her in a court judge attire with the following expressions:\n- normal default face (just a smile or a :3 will do)\n- Laughing face\n- Confused face\n- Angry face\n- Sweating face\n\n*Please feel free to decide whether or not you would like to put on a wig / a fake beard on her.\n\nSince there's quite a few of varying expressions being requested, so I increased the amount a little. Please feel feel to adjust it to your liking should it be too little for this commission.\n\nI would also like to ask sensei to include the transparent version of the emotes for easier editing.\n\nThank you for taking the time to read my request and I hope you would consider accepting my commission.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamoyamo_MO/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2704614, "client_id": 57223, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si