rous whip scars on her back. (It is not necessary to put them in the picture.) Please draw a nun with large breasts. If you wear the Sister Veil, please include the difference without it. if you have any line drawings, practice drawings, or rough drafts in PSD, I would appreciate it if you could include them. Thank you in advance.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamoyamo_MO/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2704614, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=475cc94ecd626c28fd590193f8815ecf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=475cc94ecd626c28fd590193f8815ecf, https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52ff92371e49c05493fe815a2365730a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88becbe24aeafecd68958824666dd200 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8b480a3ca932afbac565b9b897d53ec5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8b480a3ca932afbac565b9b897d53ec5, https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a7a9651bf5baef44f458fe65b6b5b1c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d1bdbd53/uploads/origins/672f69c3-56cb-491e-863b-6c4f671ed211?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f603aa1f1bbaf1f4b2f87284191ba4d3 3x"}, "body": "It is nice to meet you.\nI was attracted by the lovely deformation type of picture drawn by Yamoyamo, which I saw in the list of new arrivals on skeb, and I would like to make a request for your work.\nI saw your work at this URL (https://skeb.jp/@yamoyamo_MO/works/6).\n\nWe would like you to draw our original heroine in deformation.\nWe would like you to draw a deformed version of our original heroine.\n\nHowever, although the illustration we would like you to draw is for all ages, the original work is an NSFW work.\nIf you are still willing to draw her, we would appreciate it very much.\nIf you feel that the above is too much for you, please feel free to cancel your request.\n\nReference (silver-haired Nordic girl, calm)\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/dlr49hsd2uhnorj11sw3w/_008-nightshade-intensity-LOW-V1-glazed-intensity-10-V1.jpg?rlkey=s7jdgbtdgfq 5cnoilolfg57h1&dl=0\n\nPlease use the theme and pose as you like, Yamoja-sama.\n\nIntended use\nFor personal viewing only\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamoyamo_MO/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2704614, "client_id": 2247324, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f5a814c8/uploads/origins/93dbccb9-b5e1-4d1a-8914-e1c126ba70ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e4e3072402bc7ca4a88e71695c5a004", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f5a814c8/uploads/origins/93dbccb9-b5e1-4d1a-8914-e1c126ba70ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre