3x"}, "body": "My name is Yusei Tezuka.\n\nThank you for accepting my request last time!\nI would like to use it as an icon for X (formerly Twitter) and for my activities.\nI would like to use it for my X (old Twitter) icon and activities, so I have requested it again.\n\nPlans for use: thumbnails for distribution, SNS activities, headers, etc.\nMotifs: Books, flowers, night, dogs, Japanese style\n\nLast time, you delivered a cute deformed full-body illustration,\nThis time, we would like to ask for a more life-size illustration.\n\nBasically, we would like to use it as a thumbnail,\nWe would like to use this illustration as a thumbnail, etc., so please include the tips of the hair and shoulders in the illustration.\nAs for the background, we would be very happy if you could provide us with a transparent PNG.\n\nIf you do not have any of the above problems, we would be very grateful if you would accept our proposal.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yBdvvxkhGBY9Ut0Jg7fwa-dhOi0nZKEj?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamoyamo_MO/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2704614, "client_id": 3056098, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dafb7eec/uploads/origins/e49a342f-f2c2-46d9-a19b-2970cb4cfb99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b67461f967de712dc77a5fde61ce191c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dafb7eec/uploads/origins/e49a342f-f2c2-46d9-a19b-2970cb4cfb99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b67461f967de712dc77a5fde61ce191c, https://si.imgix.net/dafb7eec/uploads/origins/e49a342f-f2c2-46d9-a19b-2970cb4cfb99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=939dcd6c4d45a00e4a9b813a85a24730 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dafb7eec/upload